Southwark Council unanimously rejected developer Berkeley's planning application for Bermondsey Place Phases 2 and 3, at its plannig committtee meeting on 6 October.  This follows Berkeley's failure to gain approval for its Borough Triangle proposals, at the begiing of September and Aylesham Centre applications,  is the third large application from Berkeley to have failed to gain planning approval 
